Gas Distribution Plant

335
15:12.760 --> 15:13.780
for a three-year term.

336
15:13.780 --> 15:14.930
My dawn has come.

337
15:15.660 --> 15:16.980
I proposed to Ying,

338
15:18.050 --> 15:19.090
and she happily

339
15:19.090 --> 15:20.000
married me.

340
15:20.210 --> 15:21.370
At that time, I felt

341
15:21.510 --> 15:23.690
that love, career, and life

342
15:23.720 --> 15:25.120
all seemed bright.

343
15:25.320 --> 15:26.630
God favored me.

344
15:27.330 --> 15:28.760
My future was bright.

345
15:28.760 --> 15:29.450
But right at that time,

346
15:29.450 --> 15:30.830
you got into trouble.

347
15:30.960 --> 15:32.160
You went into prison.

348
15:32.460 --> 15:33.490
You stayed in prison for three years.

349
15:33.490 --> 15:33.970
After you came out,

350
15:33.970 --> 15:35.210
you went home

351
15:35.210 --> 15:36.740
and said those things to me.

352
15:38.000 --> 15:39.210
You said Ma Yiming

353
15:39.230 --> 15:40.640
saw me outside the valve pit.

354
15:40.640 --> 15:41.400
You insisted

355
15:41.400 --> 15:42.640
that I killed your father.

356
15:42.640 --> 15:44.280
Shan, I really didn't kill him.

357
15:44.280 --> 15:45.850
I just want to know

358
15:46.730 --> 15:48.260
what you are hiding from us.

359
15:48.680 --> 15:49.880
What were you doing?

360
15:51.000 --> 15:52.680
Because I was responsible for overseeing

361
15:52.680 --> 15:55.940
construction on the section where the accident happened.

362
15:56.130 --> 15:58.370
M-My mother suddenly

363
15:58.370 --> 15:59.520
became seriously ill at that time.

364
15:59.520 --> 16:02.580
I was also afraid that Wan Yang would stop me,

365
16:02.640 --> 16:04.100
so I ran home for three days

366
16:05.000 --> 16:05.760
under the guise of

367
16:05.760 --> 16:07.360
construction supervision.

368
16:07.850 --> 16:10.130
But who could have thought that after completion,

369
16:10.130 --> 16:12.330
there would be a pipeline leak.

370
16:12.330 --> 16:13.570
I was worried

371
16:14.020 --> 16:15.960
that it was the section I was responsible for,

372
16:15.960 --> 16:16.910
so I went

373
16:16.940 --> 16:18.880
to check near the valve pit.

374
16:18.910 --> 16:20.290
But on that very day,

375
16:20.310 --> 16:22.840
your father was killed in an explosion there.

376
16:23.420 --> 16:25.070
But I really was responsible

377
16:25.310 --> 16:28.460
for the section where the leak occurred.

378
16:29.240 --> 16:30.810
Could I say the truth?

379
16:31.220 --> 16:32.500
If I had said it then,

380
16:33.030 --> 16:34.400
Ying would have divorced me.

381
16:34.400 --> 16:35.280
If I had said it,

382
16:35.280 --> 16:36.400
you and Ying would have thought

383
16:36.400 --> 16:37.280
I was indirectly responsible

384
16:37.280 --> 16:38.090
for your dad's death.

385
16:38.090 --> 16:38.800
If I had said it,

386
16:38.800 --> 16:39.640
my position as director

387
16:39.640 --> 16:40.610
would be gone.

388
16:40.730 --> 16:42.540
My career had just started.

389
16:42.570 --> 16:43.490
I couldn't let this destroy

390
16:43.490 --> 16:44.920
the future I'd worked so hard for.

391
16:44.920 --> 16:45.760
All my hard work

392
16:45.760 --> 16:46.490
would have been for nothing.

393
16:46.490 --> 16:47.870
I had no choice but to lie.

394
16:47.870 --> 16:49.470
What's wrong with you, Qi Mo?

395
16:52.090 --> 16:52.570
Do you know

396
16:52.570 --> 16:53.590
how many people were harmed

397
16:53.590 --> 16:55.190
because of this lie of yours?

398
16:55.680 --> 16:56.610
Let me tell you.

399
16:57.670 --> 17:00.200
You underestimated me Ying.

400
17:00.890 --> 17:02.730
With the feelings you two had at that time,

401
17:02.730 --> 17:04.190
would she not believe you?

402
17:04.720 --> 17:07.000
You keep saying it was for the plant

403
17:07.020 --> 17:08.000
and Ying.

404
17:08.680 --> 17:09.960
Actually,

405
17:09.960 --> 17:11.880
you did it for yourself!

406
17:11.880 --> 17:12.960
Do you realize how many detours

407
17:12.960 --> 17:14.300
we've had to take because of your selfishness?

408
17:14.300 --> 17:14.780
Yes.

409
17:15.030 --> 17:16.960
I admit you're right about everything.

410
17:16.960 --> 17:18.490
I was too selfish back then.

411
17:20.240 --> 17:21.630
I also admit

412
17:23.000 --> 17:24.660
that I overestimated myself.

413
17:27.540 --> 17:28.740
I lacked experience.

414
17:29.500 --> 17:30.960
I was in too much of a hurry.

415
17:31.440 --> 17:32.680
But look at me now.

416
17:32.680 --> 17:33.980
What else

417
17:34.290 --> 17:35.420
do you want from me?

418
17:35.440 --> 17:36.800
I have nothing left.

419
17:36.830 --> 17:37.790
Do you want me to die?

420
17:37.790 --> 17:38.500
Shan.

421
17:38.520 --> 17:39.940
I also want to know now

422
17:40.070 --> 17:41.550
who exactly...

423
17:43.400 --> 17:45.330
killed your father.

424
18:01.770 --> 18:02.480
There's still a chance

425
18:02.480 --> 18:04.080
for you to make things right.

426
18:05.720 --> 18:07.780
There's a chance to uncover the truth

427
18:08.010 --> 18:10.140
and bring the real culprit to justice.

428
18:12.180 --> 18:13.910
I need you to cooperate with me.

429
18:26.920 --> 18:28.680
Qi Mo just called me.

430
18:29.340 --> 18:29.880
Yeah.

431
18:29.530 --> 18:34.220
[Finance Department]

432
18:30.240 --> 18:31.610
He called both of us too.

433
18:32.130 --> 18:33.770
He said he wanted to work here

434
18:33.790 --> 18:35.990
and asked us to put in a good word for him.

435
18:36.010 --> 18:37.050
How much hatred do these siblings

436
18:37.050 --> 18:38.640
have against him?

437
18:38.850 --> 18:40.570
They used to be a family, after all.

438
18:40.570 --> 18:41.090
Right now,

439
18:41.090 --> 18:42.130
he's fallen so low,

440
18:42.130 --> 18:42.960
and they won't even help him.

441
18:42.960 --> 18:43.920
I just think

442
18:44.010 --> 18:46.130
Qi Mo is a highly educated professional

443
18:46.130 --> 18:46.920
in his field.

444
18:47.330 --> 18:48.720
We're short-staffed.

445
18:49.530 --> 18:50.240
Why not give him a chance

446
18:50.240 --> 18:51.500
to do some useful work?

447
18:51.540 --> 18:53.720
Let's go. We should help if we can.

448
18:54.050 --> 18:55.810
Okay, I'll go get an umbrella.

449
19:04.640 --> 19:05.370
What's wrong?

450
19:05.370 --> 19:06.700
You can't do it anymore?

451
19:06.820 --> 19:08.470
Are you giving up already?

452
19:08.490 --> 19:09.830
That's not like you.

453
19:10.570 --> 19:11.910
I'm out of options.

454
19:11.940 --> 19:13.270
I'm asking you for help.

455
19:14.770 --> 19:16.560
You and Shan are close.

456
19:16.680 --> 19:18.880
Please put in a good word for me with him.

457
19:19.050 --> 19:21.440
These siblings are not hard-hearted.

458
19:21.480 --> 19:22.880
When you see them, swallow your pride a little.

459
19:22.880 --> 19:23.250
Let's go.

460
19:23.250 --> 19:23.940
-Let's go. -Let's go.

461
19:23.940 --> 19:24.340
Hurry.

462
19:24.360 --> 19:25.090
Let's go.

463
19:25.240 --> 19:25.680
Hurry.

464
19:27.460 --> 19:28.020
Come.

465
19:31.180 --> 19:31.810
Come.

466
19:31.810 --> 19:33.070
Let's eat first, Ying.

467
19:33.070 --> 19:34.010
-It'll get cold. -Shan.

468
19:34.010 --> 19:35.240
You're treated well.

469
19:35.240 --> 19:37.040
Food is delivered to the office.

470
19:37.180 --> 19:37.920
Sit.

471
19:37.920 --> 19:38.720
What a feast.

472
19:38.720 --> 19:40.540
Let me introduce you to everyone.

473
19:40.540 --> 19:41.340
Come, Auntie.

474
19:42.160 --> 19:42.720
This is

475
19:42.720 --> 19:44.570
Ma Yiming's mother.

476
19:44.880 --> 19:46.480
From now on, our meals here

477
19:46.480 --> 19:47.680
will be handled by her.

478
19:47.680 --> 19:49.280
Thank you for your hard work.

479
19:49.880 --> 19:51.770
-Eat it while it's hot. -Come on. Have a taste.

480
19:51.770 --> 19:52.630
It smells good.

481
19:52.680 --> 19:53.960
-Eat. -Hey.

482
19:54.330 --> 19:55.720
Why do you two get chicken legs?

483
19:55.720 --> 19:56.720
We only have one.

484
19:56.850 --> 19:57.640
It's unfair.

485
19:58.720 --> 19:59.830
Unfair?

486
20:00.050 --> 20:01.660
You say it's unfair?

487
20:01.880 --> 20:03.750
When my son died back then,

488
20:03.880 --> 20:06.040
I was so furious with Chen Shan I could've killed him.

489
20:06.040 --> 20:07.720
I hit him and yelled at him.

490
20:08.010 --> 20:09.650
But as soon as Chen Shan got out of prison,

491
20:09.650 --> 20:10.820
he went to my house.

492
20:10.850 --> 20:12.330
I had a heart attack at that time

493
20:12.330 --> 20:13.610
and was lying on the ground.

494
20:13.610 --> 20:15.370
He carried me to the hospital on his back

495
20:15.370 --> 20:17.200
and looked after me day and night for three days.

496
20:17.200 --> 20:18.010
He also said

497
20:18.010 --> 20:18.850
Those three days...

498
20:18.850 --> 20:21.500
he would provide for me in my old age.

499
20:21.680 --> 20:23.010
If you can do that for me,

500
20:23.070 --> 20:25.200
I'll give you an extra chicken leg too.

501
20:25.440 --> 20:26.290
Have a taste.

502
20:26.370 --> 20:27.090
Mr. Qi.

503
20:27.090 --> 20:28.000
Come in.

504
20:28.020 --> 20:28.640
We were just about to eat.

505
20:28.640 --> 20:29.400
Let's talk after eating.

506
20:29.400 --> 20:29.920
Hurry.

507
20:30.010 --> 20:32.410
-Let's eat together. Sit down. -Sit there.

508
20:32.720 --> 20:33.530
Xiaoyun.

509
20:33.530 --> 20:34.420
I saved these dishes

510
20:34.420 --> 20:35.210
for you two.

511
20:35.240 --> 20:37.530
Eat while it's hot.

512
20:38.570 --> 20:40.440
I cook for people, not for you.

513
20:40.570 --> 20:41.880
I'd rather let it go to waste than give you any!

514
20:41.880 --> 20:42.680
Okay.

515
20:42.770 --> 20:43.570
Ma'am.

516
20:43.640 --> 20:44.680
That's a bit harsh.

517
20:44.680 --> 20:45.480
I won't eat.

518
20:45.680 --> 20:46.610
You guys eat.

519
20:46.610 --> 20:47.370
You guys eat.

520
20:47.720 --> 20:48.560
Qi Mo.

521
20:48.580 --> 20:49.610
If you don't remember me,

522
20:49.610 --> 20:50.240
you should remember

523
20:50.240 --> 20:51.770
my son, Ma Yiming, right?

524
20:51.770 --> 20:52.680
What are you doing?

525
20:52.680 --> 20:54.610
He was almost blown up.

526
20:54.610 --> 20:57.200
Chen Fu gave his life to save him.

527
20:58.640 --> 21:00.680
Then he woke up and got better.

528
21:00.920 --> 21:02.090
But he and Chen Shan

529
21:02.090 --> 21:03.610
tried to stop a devil like you

530
21:03.610 --> 21:05.510
from staying by Chen Ying's side.

531
21:05.610 --> 21:08.380
That's why he ended up in that car accident!

532
21:08.530 --> 21:09.400
Don't you owe him for his life?

533
21:09.400 --> 21:10.390
Calm down.

534
21:10.480 --> 21:11.680
What does it have to do with me?

535
21:11.680 --> 21:12.290
What does your son's death

536
21:12.290 --> 21:13.090
have to do with me?

537
21:13.090 --> 21:13.920
Stay away!

538
21:15.480 --> 21:16.070
Ma'am.

539
21:16.130 --> 21:17.640
Your heart is already weak.

540
21:17.640 --> 21:18.370
Don't ruin your health

541
21:18.370 --> 21:19.440
because of this.

542
21:19.440 --> 21:20.050
Right.

543
21:20.050 --> 21:20.400
Come, Ma'am.

544
21:20.400 --> 21:20.880
Alright.

545
21:20.880 --> 21:22.180
Please calm down.

546
21:22.330 --> 21:23.570
Good is rewarded,

547
21:23.570 --> 21:25.010
and evil is punished!

548
21:25.010 --> 21:26.240
What are you doing? Don't hit him, Ma'am.

549
21:26.240 --> 21:27.630
Calm down.

550
21:27.720 --> 21:28.680
Don't get worked up.

551
21:28.680 --> 21:30.160
Get some good rest.

552
21:32.640 --> 21:33.440
Jie.

553
21:34.400 --> 21:35.530
What does this mean?

554
21:36.880 --> 21:39.130
Qi Mo's been running a stall outside the plant gate

555
21:39.130 --> 21:40.090
for over a month.

556
21:40.090 --> 21:41.570
Everyone has seen it.

557
21:42.050 --> 21:44.360
So he must have reflected on his behavior

558
21:44.480 --> 21:46.290
and changed his ways by now.

559
21:46.480 --> 21:47.510
So we thought

560
21:50.390 --> 21:51.570
we'd give him a chance.

561
21:51.570 --> 21:53.680
Do you think it's appropriate to do this?

562
21:53.680 --> 21:55.150
So what if he runs that stall for a whole year?

563
21:55.150 --> 21:56.880
What does it have to do with you?

564
21:57.370 --> 21:58.130
You gave him a chance

565
21:58.130 --> 21:59.090
without even asking us,

566
21:59.090 --> 21:59.750
didn't you?

567
22:06.880 --> 22:07.610
Chen Shan.

568
22:07.720 --> 22:09.200
I have a background in design, after all.

569
22:09.200 --> 22:10.090
Didn't you hear

570
22:10.090 --> 22:11.350
what Auntie just said?

571
22:12.440 --> 22:13.640
What are you here for?

572
22:14.220 --> 22:15.680
Why did you bring him here?

573
22:15.960 --> 22:16.640
You came here

574
22:16.640 --> 22:17.680
to cause more deaths,

575
22:17.680 --> 22:18.340
didn't you?

576
22:19.160 --> 22:19.960
No, no.

577
22:20.850 --> 22:22.330
Chen Shan, don't talk like that.

578
22:22.330 --> 22:24.200
Don't always

579
22:24.240 --> 22:25.290
talk about deaths.

580
22:25.290 --> 22:26.240
You can't pin

581
22:26.240 --> 22:28.240
all the blame on me!

582
22:28.240 --> 22:29.090
Xiaoyun.

583
22:29.090 --> 22:30.160
Say something for me, Xiaoyun.

584
22:30.160 --> 22:30.440
Xiaoyun.

585
22:30.440 --> 22:31.720
Stay away from Ying.

586
22:32.850 --> 22:33.530
Xiaoyun.

587
22:33.810 --> 22:34.880
We are husband and wife, after all.

588
22:34.880 --> 22:36.130
Even one day together is supposed to earn a lifetime of goodwill.

589
22:36.130 --> 22:37.160
Say something to him.

590
22:37.160 --> 22:37.720
How is he

591
22:37.720 --> 22:39.520
talking to me?

592
22:42.020 --> 22:43.770
That reminds me.

593
22:44.090 --> 22:44.880
Qi Mo,

594
22:45.330 --> 22:45.960
get the divorce finalized

595
22:45.960 --> 22:47.290
as soon as possible.

596
22:47.640 --> 22:49.090
I don't want to look at

597
22:49.090 --> 22:50.690
a murderer's face every day.

598
22:52.200 --> 22:53.480
You bastard!

599
22:53.540 --> 22:54.480
Peng Xiaoyun, you bastard!

600
22:54.480 --> 22:54.960
What are you doing?

601
22:54.960 --> 22:56.160
Peng Xiaoyun, you...

602
22:56.200 --> 22:57.460
My name is not Xiaoyun.

603
22:58.950 --> 23:00.320
My name is Chen Ying.

604
23:02.200 --> 23:03.200
Did you hear that?

605
23:03.770 --> 23:05.500
Stay away from our Chen family.

606
23:07.160 --> 23:08.020
Get lost!

607
23:10.090 --> 23:10.880
You...

608
23:14.710 --> 23:15.270
Hello.

609
23:16.330 --> 23:16.770
Speak.

610
23:19.580 --> 23:20.640
A malfunction?

611
23:20.880 --> 23:21.570
Where?

612
23:23.480 --> 23:24.200
Okay.

613
23:24.810 --> 23:25.870
Tomorrow morning,

614
23:25.920 --> 23:27.810
I'll bring a team to fix it.

615
23:28.720 --> 23:31.090
Well, about today,

616
23:31.370 --> 23:32.370
thanks.

617
23:33.530 --> 23:34.960
I made you

618
23:34.960 --> 23:37.680
get a snub from Chen Shan.

619
23:38.410 --> 23:39.340
That's too much.

620
23:39.440 --> 23:41.640
The siblings really went too far today.

621
23:42.610 --> 23:44.640
Ever since Chen Ying and I got married,

622
23:44.640 --> 23:47.480
everyone at the company has known

623
23:48.090 --> 23:50.920
that no matter how busy I am with work, I never let her

624
23:50.920 --> 23:52.650
lift a finger around the house.

625
23:53.290 --> 23:54.330
And Chen Shan,

626
23:54.810 --> 23:56.330
since he got out of prison,

627
23:56.480 --> 23:57.720
has treated me

628
23:57.720 --> 23:58.440
like dirt.

629
23:58.440 --> 23:58.850
But I still

630
23:58.850 --> 24:00.510
arranged a job for him, right?

631
24:00.680 --> 24:02.540
I've been kind to these siblings.

632
24:02.880 --> 24:04.920
But look how they treated me today.

633
24:04.920 --> 24:05.880
Calm down.

634
24:06.480 --> 24:07.720
I just don't understand.

635
24:07.720 --> 24:10.640
Just because of something Ma Yiming said,

636
24:11.130 --> 24:12.160
they've decided

637
24:12.160 --> 24:14.770
I'm guilty?

638
24:19.480 --> 24:20.330
You tell me.

639
24:20.880 --> 24:22.370
You know better than anyone

640
24:22.370 --> 24:23.630
whether I had anything

641
24:23.810 --> 24:25.330
to do with Chen Fu's death.

642
24:34.640 --> 24:35.700
His father's death

643
24:37.440 --> 24:40.200
was caused by Wan Yang

644
24:40.570 --> 24:42.470
replacing that unqualified

645
24:42.530 --> 24:43.720
flange,

646
24:44.050 --> 24:44.720
wasn't it?

647
24:45.240 --> 24:46.050
Yes.

648
24:46.530 --> 24:47.480
What could any

649
24:47.770 --> 24:49.130
of this have to do with you?

650
24:49.130 --> 24:50.010
It has nothing to do with me.

651
24:50.010 --> 24:51.920
But they're trying to destroy me.

652
24:52.240 --> 24:52.960
Jie.

653
24:53.920 --> 24:55.530
Let me give you a piece of advice.

654
24:55.530 --> 24:55.970
Really.

655
24:55.970 --> 24:57.270
Listen to my advice.

656
24:57.370 --> 24:58.850
Stay away from

657
24:59.020 --> 25:00.010
those siblings.

658
25:01.330 --> 25:02.860
Did you have something to do

659
25:03.440 --> 25:04.770
with Wanyang replacing

660
25:04.940 --> 25:06.410
that flange back then?

661
25:09.460 --> 25:11.200
Chen Shan might

662
25:11.200 --> 25:13.470
dig this up and investigate it again.

663
25:13.640 --> 25:14.370
He won't rest

664
25:14.370 --> 25:15.330
until he's dug up

665
25:15.330 --> 25:16.010
every last thing

666
25:16.010 --> 25:16.530
from your past.

667
25:16.530 --> 25:18.130
He's determined to destroy you.

668
25:18.130 --> 25:19.010
Just look at Wan Yang,

669
25:19.010 --> 25:19.770
Geng Jian,

670
25:19.770 --> 25:20.570
and me.

671
25:20.720 --> 25:22.130
We are living examples.

672
25:22.540 --> 25:23.890
Calm down. Calm down.

673
25:24.270 --> 25:24.820
Come.

674
25:25.410 --> 25:26.810
Thanks for the reminder.

675
25:31.400 --> 25:32.910
Bring two more bottles of liquor.

676
25:32.910 --> 25:33.860
Coming, coming.

677
25:36.340 --> 25:37.830
Why are you two here?

678
25:37.960 --> 25:38.810
Wang Pengju?

679
25:39.230 --> 25:40.190
Why are you here?

680
25:40.330 --> 25:41.160
I was laid off.

681
25:41.160 --> 25:43.420
I've got to find some way to make a living.

682
25:44.330 --> 25:45.720
Can I sit here for a while?

683
25:45.720 --> 25:46.330
Come, come.

684
25:46.330 --> 25:47.050
Sit, sit.

685
25:47.050 --> 25:47.850
Manager Qi.

686
25:50.170 --> 25:50.970
Well...

687
25:51.000 --> 25:52.860
Don't

688
25:52.920 --> 25:54.320
call me Manager Qi.

689
25:54.530 --> 25:56.570
I've been stripped of that title.

690
25:56.570 --> 25:57.330
How have you been?

691
25:57.330 --> 25:59.330
How come you've lost so much weight?

692
25:59.570 --> 26:01.900
It's from running the hot pot restaurant.

693
26:02.610 --> 26:05.640
I heard you and Chen Ying got divorced.

694
26:06.850 --> 26:08.090
Not completely yet.

695
26:08.570 --> 26:09.770
You should have done it long ago,

696
26:09.770 --> 26:10.570
really.

697
26:11.090 --> 26:13.220
I was too embarrassed to say it before.

698
26:13.570 --> 26:14.370
Those two—

699
26:14.370 --> 26:15.640
what kind of people are they?

700
26:15.640 --> 26:16.440
A few days ago,

701
26:16.960 --> 26:18.680
I don't know how,

702
26:18.680 --> 26:19.330
but they somehow

703
26:19.330 --> 26:21.110
ended up eating here.

704
26:21.400 --> 26:22.400
They saw my daughter

705
26:22.400 --> 26:23.770
wearing a small gold longevity lock

706
26:23.770 --> 26:26.170
and insisted it belonged to Zhang Wenying.

707
26:26.610 --> 26:28.530
They said their dad's death had something to do with me.

708
26:28.530 --> 26:29.920
I just picked up a small gold longevity lock.

709
26:29.920 --> 26:31.160
How could I have anything to do

710
26:31.160 --> 26:32.490
with their dad's death?

711
26:32.710 --> 26:34.160
Where did you pick it up?

712
26:34.160 --> 26:35.920
After Chen Fu had his accident,

713
26:35.920 --> 26:36.920
our security department was asked

714
26:36.920 --> 26:38.240
to seal off the scene, right?

715
26:38.240 --> 26:40.070
I picked it up at that valve pit.

716
26:41.330 --> 26:42.530
Then you're done for.

717
26:43.880 --> 26:45.090
They will definitely

718
26:45.090 --> 26:46.160
hound you relentlessly.

719
26:46.160 --> 26:46.770
They'll dig into

720
26:46.770 --> 26:48.440
every last detail.

721
26:48.480 --> 26:49.290
Let them.

722
26:49.920 --> 26:51.720
Let them hound me relentlessly.

723
26:51.920 --> 26:53.370
Chen Shan even threatened me,

724
26:53.370 --> 26:55.770
saying he would give the lock to the police.

725
26:56.770 --> 26:58.040
Let him.

726
26:58.330 --> 26:59.530
Who's afraid of whom?

727
27:00.910 --> 27:02.700
Knowing those siblings,

728
27:02.920 --> 27:03.680
they'll dig up the explosion case

729
27:03.680 --> 27:05.160
and investigate it all over again.

730
27:05.160 --> 27:05.850
They have to figure out

731
27:05.850 --> 27:07.160
how the lock ended up

732
27:07.160 --> 27:08.160
at the valve pit.

733
27:08.240 --> 27:09.090
If they can't figure this out,

734
27:09.090 --> 27:11.810
they won't let it go.

735
27:11.810 --> 27:14.070
Then let them investigate all they want.

736
27:14.290 --> 27:15.130
I don't believe

737
27:15.130 --> 27:16.010
they can find

738
27:16.010 --> 27:16.920
another murderer.

739
27:16.920 --> 27:18.400
Those two have lost their minds.

740
27:18.400 --> 27:20.400
Now they see a murderer in everyone.

741
27:20.810 --> 27:22.370
Can we not talk about this?

742
27:22.370 --> 27:23.160
It's rare for us to meet.

743
27:23.160 --> 27:24.130
Let's just drink, okay?

744
27:24.130 --> 27:24.940
Come on.

745
27:25.560 --> 27:26.360
Come on.

746
27:26.430 --> 27:27.910
Long time no see.

747
27:50.490 --> 27:54.840
[Cultivate virtue and uphold what is right]

748
28:03.760 --> 28:05.760
[Ying]

749
28:04.760 --> 28:06.290
I just picked up a small gold longevity lock.

750
28:06.290 --> 28:07.530
How could I be related

751
28:07.530 --> 28:08.590
to his dad's death?

752
28:09.640 --> 28:11.400
I picked it up at that valve pit.

753
28:14.850 --> 28:16.330
Chen Shan even threatened me

754
28:16.330 --> 28:18.910
that he would give the gold longevity lock to the police.

755
28:18.910 --> 28:19.470
Read it.

756
28:22.480 --> 28:25.200
July 17th,

757
28:25.220 --> 28:28.670
received one gold longevity lock

758
28:29.040 --> 28:30.170
from Zhang Wenying,

759
28:31.240 --> 28:32.410
forwarded by Wan Yang.

760
28:32.410 --> 28:34.010
What kind of gold longevity lock?

761
28:34.010 --> 28:35.140
How much is it worth?

762
28:35.200 --> 28:38.240
It's about the size of a thumbnail.

763
28:38.330 --> 28:41.610
It's worth no more than 5,000.

764
28:41.700 --> 28:43.560
Where is the gold longevity lock?

765
28:44.080 --> 28:45.200
I think I've lost it.

766
28:45.200 --> 28:45.970
Note it down.

767
28:45.870 --> 28:47.640
[Approx. RMB 5,000 Missing]

768
28:46.540 --> 28:48.340
The gold longevity lock is lost.

769
28:50.340 --> 28:51.370
A malfunction?

770
28:51.640 --> 28:52.640
I'll take the team

771
28:52.820 --> 28:54.710
to repair it tomorrow morning.

772
29:37.020 --> 29:40.260
[Cultivate virtue and uphold what is right]

773
29:49.840 --> 29:56.350
[Cultivate virtue and uphold what is right]

774
30:31.630 --> 30:32.860
[Cultivate virtue and uphold what is right]

775
30:49.460 --> 30:51.280
[Maintenance Ahead. Keep Away]

776
31:04.530 --> 31:05.920
The current location is right here.

777
31:05.920 --> 31:06.480
Right.

778
31:07.050 --> 31:07.850
Captain He,

779
31:08.210 --> 31:09.020
take your men

780
31:09.050 --> 31:10.450
to survey the site again.

781
31:10.720 --> 31:11.920
You must find out the cause

782
31:11.920 --> 31:12.810
of the malfunction first.

783
31:12.810 --> 31:13.480
Okay.

784
31:14.930 --> 31:16.160
I'll leave the repair plan

785
31:16.160 --> 31:16.880
to you.

786
31:16.880 --> 31:18.130
Okay, I'll do it as soon as possible.

787
31:18.130 --> 31:19.530
Do it as soon as possible.

788
32:02.530 --> 32:06.400
[Ying]

789
32:18.360 --> 32:22.060
[Ying]

790
32:46.480 --> 32:47.720
You want to blow us up,

791
32:49.160 --> 32:50.480
just like you blew up my dad back then,

792
32:50.480 --> 32:51.200
don't you?

793
32:54.290 --> 32:55.820
I didn't want to blow him up.

794
32:56.350 --> 32:57.160
I didn't.

795
32:58.950 --> 33:00.280
I tried to persuade him.

796
33:00.400 --> 33:01.130
I kept persuading him.

797
33:01.130 --> 33:02.130
I talked to him all night,

798
33:02.130 --> 33:03.370
practically wearing my voice out,

799
33:03.370 --> 33:04.970
but he just wouldn't listen.

800
33:05.610 --> 33:06.900
He insisted on reporting me

801
33:06.900 --> 33:08.560
and Wan Yang.

802
33:10.680 --> 33:12.440
He pushed me to a dead end.

803
33:12.720 --> 33:15.290
What else could I do?

804
33:29.010 --> 33:29.810
Shan.

805
33:32.370 --> 33:33.640
Honestly,

806
33:34.960 --> 33:37.050
since I really got to know you,

807
33:37.810 --> 33:38.610
I wanted to be

808
33:40.440 --> 33:42.240
a good person for the first time.

809
33:45.570 --> 33:46.330
Being good

810
33:48.920 --> 33:49.720
feels good.

811
33:50.810 --> 33:53.810
Ever since the day you killed my dad in that explosion,

812
33:54.920 --> 33:56.770
there was no turning back for you.

813
33:56.770 --> 33:57.460
Freeze!

814
33:58.720 --> 33:59.590
Nobody move!

815
34:47.179 --> 34:49.330
Pursuant to Article 274 of the Criminal Law

816
34:49.330 --> 34:51.260
of the People's Republic of China,

817
34:51.679 --> 34:52.610
the court hereby

818
34:53.639 --> 34:56.280
sentences the defendant, Liu Hong,

819
34:56.719 --> 34:58.850
to nine years in prison for extortion.

820
35:07.160 --> 35:08.800
As decided by this court's

821
35:08.800 --> 35:10.000
judicial committee,

822
35:10.090 --> 35:12.610
and pursuant to Article 115 of the Criminal Law

823
35:12.610 --> 35:14.640
of the People's Republic of China,

824
35:14.800 --> 35:17.410
the defendant, Sun Jie, is sentenced to death

825
35:17.760 --> 35:19.340
for the crime of causing an explosion

826
35:19.340 --> 35:22.200
and shall be deprived of political rights for life.

827
36:10.720 --> 36:11.360
Qi Mo.

828
36:12.170 --> 36:13.450
The investigation into your case

829
36:13.450 --> 36:14.570
is now complete.

830
36:15.130 --> 36:16.860
After careful consideration,

831
36:17.090 --> 36:17.970
we've decided to arrange for you

832
36:17.970 --> 36:19.360
to attend a full-time management

833
36:19.360 --> 36:19.970
training program

834
36:19.970 --> 36:21.840
at the provincial level

835
36:21.870 --> 36:24.070
to strengthen your management skills.

836
36:24.640 --> 36:26.320
After completing the program,

837
36:26.320 --> 36:27.610
you'll return to the company

838
36:27.610 --> 36:29.320
and be assigned to a new role.

839
36:38.350 --> 36:39.080
Ying.

840
36:39.840 --> 36:41.680
I'm heading to the provincial training program,

841
36:41.680 --> 36:43.010
so I came to say goodbye.

842
36:54.830 --> 36:55.680
Plan scientifically. Deliver tangible results]

843
36:55.700 --> 36:56.800
[Take environmental protection to a new level]

844
37:04.570 --> 37:05.500
Hello, Mr. Chen.

845
37:09.680 --> 37:10.610
Hello, Mr. Chen.

846
37:13.680 --> 37:14.320
Mr. Chen.

847
37:14.320 --> 37:14.850
Mr. Chen.

848
37:20.200 --> 37:21.930
Mr. Chen, what brings you here?

849
37:23.250 --> 37:24.770
Can I sit here for a while?

850
37:28.800 --> 37:29.610
My dad

851
37:30.680 --> 37:32.460
used to sit here.

852
37:32.600 --> 37:33.570
No problem. Please sit.

853
37:33.570 --> 37:34.280
Please.

854
37:34.280 --> 37:34.890
Please sit.

855
37:34.890 --> 37:35.600
Thank you.

856
37:53.360 --> 37:54.630
It's still this chair.

857
37:57.140 --> 37:58.460
It's still this desk.

858
38:04.490 --> 38:05.730
I'm not taking over.

859
38:06.150 --> 38:07.160
I want to go out on my own

860
38:07.160 --> 38:07.680
and make a living.

861
38:07.680 --> 38:08.840
You think just anyone

862
38:08.840 --> 38:10.840
can get into the construction team?

863
38:10.930 --> 38:12.330
Come, help me stick this.

864
38:15.240 --> 38:15.930
Where?

865
38:17.930 --> 38:18.530
Here.

866
38:18.790 --> 38:20.170
Do you know how many people

867
38:20.170 --> 38:21.930
are dying to join the construction team?

868
38:21.930 --> 38:23.390
But I don't even want them.

869
38:23.650 --> 38:25.010
I'm giving you a chance,

870
38:25.010 --> 38:26.090
but you don't even cherish it.

871
38:26.090 --> 38:27.970
My legs are my own.

872
38:28.270 --> 38:30.410
You stubborn dog,

873
38:30.410 --> 38:32.160
you've really set your mind in stone.

874
38:32.160 --> 38:33.890
Are you trying to piss me off?

875
38:34.690 --> 38:35.370
Dad,

876
38:36.050 --> 38:37.250
if I'm a dog,

877
38:37.270 --> 38:38.450
what does that make you?

878
38:38.450 --> 38:40.050
-I… -The old dog, obviously.

879
38:42.200 --> 38:43.330
Laughing?

880
38:43.680 --> 38:44.680
Just you wait.

881
38:58.350 --> 38:59.470
I remember before,

882
39:00.910 --> 39:03.170
every time Dad asked me to join the plant,

883
39:03.940 --> 39:04.680
I couldn't wait

884
39:04.680 --> 39:06.410
to escape Wugang immediately.

885
39:07.990 --> 39:09.920
Now I've finally joined the plant,

886
39:11.320 --> 39:13.520
but it's a shame Dad isn't here to see it.

887
39:14.490 --> 39:15.410
Dad can see it.

888
39:16.800 --> 39:17.930
Wherever you are,

889
39:19.340 --> 39:21.000
you'll always make Dad proud.

890
39:22.410 --> 39:23.200
Keep it up.

891
39:25.460 --> 39:26.210
Mr. Chen.

892
39:33.790 --> 39:37.330
[One year later]

893
39:51.060 --> 39:51.710
Ying.

894
39:52.430 --> 39:53.870
Did you get my medicine?

895
39:54.020 --> 39:55.050
I did.

896
39:56.280 --> 39:57.610
What's wrong?

897
39:58.050 --> 39:59.650
I... I slept on my neck wrong.

898
40:01.220 --> 40:02.030
Here?

899
40:04.680 --> 40:06.650
Don't move. Don't move. Don't move.

900
40:06.650 --> 40:07.910
Does it hurt that much?

901
40:11.160 --> 40:11.970
Ying,

902
40:12.670 --> 40:13.760
we are going

903
40:13.870 --> 40:15.460
to the Northwest this time.

904
40:16.050 --> 40:17.250
Are you okay to drive?

905
40:19.940 --> 40:21.740
Don't you trust me?

906
40:24.210 --> 40:25.940
[Practical Road Atlas of China]

907
40:25.080 --> 40:27.010
The person I trust most in this world

908
40:27.010 --> 40:27.930
is you.

909
40:29.090 --> 40:29.970
I bought you some ye'erba.

910
40:29.970 --> 40:31.170
Eat it while it's hot.

911
40:31.800 --> 40:33.010
Let's go.

912
40:33.260 --> 40:34.240
Shan.

913
40:34.910 --> 40:36.020
Actually...

914
40:38.420 --> 40:39.830
Honestly, the result

915
40:40.890 --> 40:41.490
doesn't matter

916
40:41.490 --> 40:42.890
to me anymore.

917
40:47.400 --> 40:48.920
But I want to know.

918
40:52.440 --> 40:53.420
Are you sure?

919
40:55.880 --> 40:56.680
Let's go.

920
41:23.820 --> 41:26.070
♪ You guess, I guess ♪

921
41:26.170 --> 41:28.350
♪ You say, I say ♪

922
41:28.460 --> 41:31.880
♪ Longing can consume us ♪

923
41:31.900 --> 41:34.240
♪ No asking, no crying ♪

924
41:33.640 --> 41:34.720
We've journeyed through the darkness,

925
41:34.260 --> 41:36.310
♪ No thinking, no speaking ♪

926
41:34.720 --> 41:36.320
time after time.

927
41:36.400 --> 41:40.230
♪ The haze slowly clears away ♪

928
41:37.800 --> 41:39.800
The pain left unspoken,

929
41:40.310 --> 41:42.930
♪ Being wild, acting spoiled ♪

930
41:41.680 --> 41:43.130
the answers still unfound—

931
41:42.950 --> 41:44.730
♪ Unchanged, undefeated ♪

932
41:44.560 --> 41:46.190
all await the break of dawn.

933
41:44.840 --> 41:48.280
♪ Growing up starts right now ♪

934
41:48.460 --> 41:50.470
♪ Don't look back ♪

935
41:50.580 --> 41:52.600
♪ You see, I see ♪

936
41:52.900 --> 41:56.260
♪ The sun is rising ♪

937
42:00.410 --> 42:02.210
No matter how deep the darkness,

938
42:03.660 --> 42:05.320
the light will find its way in.

939
42:06.930 --> 42:09.870
Through it all, we'll walk toward the light

940
42:11.090 --> 42:12.290
and light the dark.

941
42:12.740 --> 42:15.930
♪ Your smile is so beautiful ♪

942
42:16.710 --> 42:20.580
♪ It guards the beat of my heart ♪

943
42:20.740 --> 42:25.180
♪ Time keeps running on ♪

944
42:25.330 --> 42:28.850
♪ Your arms are soft and warm ♪

945
42:28.880 --> 42:32.950
♪ I see the stars smiling ♪

946
42:32.970 --> 42:37.070
♪ I hear the wind playfully sigh ♪

947
42:35.110 --> 42:36.760
[After a month of investigation, Chen Ying and Chen Shan discovered]

948
42:36.790 --> 42:38.510
[that Chen Ying's biological parents died in 1978]

949
42:37.180 --> 42:41.010
♪ Time is still burning bright ♪

950
42:38.530 --> 42:40.980
[in an accident while surveying the terrain in the Gobi Desert.]

951
42:41.000 --> 42:43.810
[The accident was caused by a minor local earthquake.]

952
42:41.040 --> 42:49.460
♪ Lighting up the lonely souls in this world ♪

953
42:43.830 --> 42:47.140
[Zhang Wenying and Chen Fu had nothing to do with it.]

954
42:47.160 --> 42:49.960
[Nor were there any construction or design flaws, contrary to Wan Yang's claims.]
